    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95515" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμί̄λ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>knife for cutting</i> or
				<i>carving</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				779
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				353a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				98.13
			</span></i>; <i>graving tool, sculptor's chisel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.429
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i>); <i>surgeon's knife</i> or <i>lancet</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεβοτόμος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.181
			</span></i>; <i>shoemaker's knife</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1.129c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				7.119
			</span></i>; <i>vinedresser's pruning-knife,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				5.35.1
			</span></i> (but v.
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				353a
			</span></i>); <i>penknife,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.67
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>), etc.: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμῖλα</span>.</div>
